\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Available-pair MAE, averaged equally over query budgets, separated by data source. Small dots show supported seeds; vertical marks show their descriptive mean. Parentheses give supported seed counts; the asterisk marks missing Commonsense records at seeds 5003 and 9001. All four methods use identical case--seed support. Missing-output penalties are not plotted as measured errors. These conditional results do not restore failed qualification.}}{7}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cases}{{2}{7}{Available-pair MAE, averaged equally over query budgets, separated by data source. Small dots show supported seeds; vertical marks show their descriptive mean. Parentheses give supported seed counts; the asterisk marks missing Commonsense records at seeds 5003 and 9001. All four methods use identical case--seed support. Missing-output penalties are not plotted as measured errors. These conditional results do not restore failed qualification}{figure.caption.7}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Conditional error and ranking at each budget. Large dots use equal data-source and case weights, with available seeds normalized within each case. Small dots are descriptive seed summaries normalized over cases available for that seed; they are not independent replicates of the pooled estimator. Both panels and all methods use the same available case--seed intersection. No confidence interval or qualified overall comparison is implied.}}{7}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:budgets}{{3}{7}{Conditional error and ranking at each budget. Large dots use equal data-source and case weights, with available seeds normalized within each case. Small dots are descriptive seed summaries normalized over cases available for that seed; they are not independent replicates of the pooled estimator. Both panels and all methods use the same available case--seed intersection. No confidence interval or qualified overall comparison is implied}{figure.caption.8}{}}
